flowchart TB
    User[Viber user]
    AdminUser[Admin user]
    ViberAPI[Viber API]
    ExternalAI[Cloud LLM]
    Ollama[Ollama optional]

    subgraph Runtime["Runtime"]
        Admin[Admin service]
        Viber[Viber service]
        Route[Step routing]
        AI[AI service]
    end

    subgraph Stores["Stores"]
        Mongo[(MongoDB<br/>admin_service / bot / ai)]
        RabbitMQ[RabbitMQ<br/>viber.refresh]
        Chroma[(Chroma optional RAG)]
    end

    User -->|1 send message| ViberAPI
    ViberAPI -->|2 POST /webhook/viber| Viber
    Viber -->|3 load/cache steps from Admin REST| Admin
    Viber -->|4 route step| Route
    Route -->|CMS step reply| Viber
    Route -->|5 gRPC ProcessMessage| AI
    AI -->|6 LLM| ExternalAI
    AI -.->|6b local-llm| Ollama
    AI -.->|6c retrieve| Chroma
    AI -->|7 response| Viber
    Viber -->|8 send reply| ViberAPI
    ViberAPI -->|9 deliver| User
    Viber -->|persist as needed| Mongo
    AI -->|persist as needed| Mongo

    AdminUser -->|A login / CMS CRUD| Admin
    Admin -->|B write content| Mongo
    Admin -->|C publish RefreshEvent| RabbitMQ
    RabbitMQ -->|D invalidate cache| Viber

